<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Strategic digital marketing for personal brands, professionals, local businesses and ecommerce. Grow visibility, leads, subscribers and sales.">
<title>Stack Leads Marketing | Strategic Digital Marketing</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#111827;--muted:#64748b;--navy:#101b35;--blue:#4169e1;--cyan:#59d6d0;--cream:#f7f8fc;--line:#e5eaf2;--white:#fff;--gold:#f3b84b}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.topbar{background:#0c1428;color:#dbe5ff;font-size:13px;padding:9px 0}.topbar .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.navin{height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.5px;font-size:20px}.brand-logo{width:64px;height:64px;object-fit:contain;display:block;border-radius:8px}.footer-brand{font-size:21px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.3px;color:#fff}.links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;color:#46536b;font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blue);color:white;font-weight:750;border:0;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 20px #4169e133;transition:.2s}.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 26px #4169e144}.btn.dark{background:var(--navy)}.btn.outline{background:transparent;border:1px solid #ffffff66;box-shadow:none}.hero{background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 15%,#3159b9 0,transparent 28%),linear-gradient(120deg,#0d1730 0%,#172b55 58%,#183b58 100%);color:white;padding:92px 0 82px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:520px;height:520px;border:1px solid #ffffff1c;border-radius:50%;right:-140px;bottom:-300px;box-shadow:0 0 0 50px #ffffff08,0 0 0 100px #ffffff06}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:54px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:1}.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;color:#9ce8e4;font-size:12px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--cyan)}h1{font-size:clamp(42px,5.6vw,68px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-2.6px;margin:18px 0 22px;max-width:700px}.gradient{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8be9e2,#a9c4ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}.hero p{font-size:18px;color:#d2dcf0;max-width:620px;margin:0 0 30px}.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap}.trustline{margin-top:30px;color:#b7c6e2;font-size:13px}.visual{position:relative;min-height:390px;display:grid;place-items:center}.orbit{width:330px;height:330px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #ffffff35;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(circle,#ffffff12,transparent 68%)}.orbit:before,.orbit:after{content:"";position:absolute;border:1px solid #ffffff22;border-radius:50%;inset:28px}.orbit:after{inset:65px}.core{width:145px;height:145px;border-radius:34px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#557cf1,#50cfc9);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:40px;box-shadow:0 25px 70px #0005;transform:rotate(-8deg)}.float{position:absolute;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);padding:13px 16px;border-radius:13px;box-shadow:0 15px 45px #0003;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.float small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}.f1{top:38px;left:-4px}.f2{right:-8px;top:110px}.f3{bottom:34px;left:10px}.f4{bottom:55px;right:0}.section{padding:84px 0}.soft{background:var(--cream)}.section-head{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 42px}.kicker{color:var(--blue);font-size:12px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase}.section h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);letter-spacing:-1.4px;line-height:1.12;margin:12px 0}.section-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;margin:14px 0 0}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:-1px}.stat{padding:24px;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.stat:last-child{border:0}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:26px;color:var(--navy);letter-spacing:-1px}.stat span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.grid4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}.service{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;padding:25px;transition:.2s}.service:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 18px 45px #15254b12}.ico{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;background:#edf2ff;color:var(--blue);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:23px;margin-bottom:18px}.service h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px}.service p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;color:#3457bf;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:55px;align-items:center}.split p{color:var(--muted)}.checklist{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:25px 0}.checklist li{display:flex;gap:12px;margin:13px 0;color:#39465d}.check{width:23px;height:23px;flex:0 0 23px;border-radius:50%;background:#e4f8f5;color:#168c83;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;font-size:13px}.panel{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#101b35,#203e72);color:white;border-radius:24px;padding:32px;box-shadow:0 22px 50px #15254b24}.panel h3{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 8px}.panel>p{color:#c4d2eb}.funnel{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:24px}.funnel div{padding:13px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:#ffffff12;border:1px solid #ffffff20;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:14px}.funnel b{color:#8de4de}.audiences{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}.aud{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:21px;background:#fff}.aud b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px}.aud span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;counter-reset:step}.step{padding:24px;border-top:3px solid var(--blue);background:white;border-radius:0 0 14px 14px}.step:before{counter-increment:step;content:"0" counter(step);font-size:12px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px}.step h3{margin:9px 0 7px}.step p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.cta{background:linear-gradient(115deg,#15264b,#254d82);color:white;padding:68px 0}.cta-in{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:30px}.cta h2{font-size:clamp(29px,4vw,42px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-1.2px;margin:0 0 10px}.cta p{color:#d1def2;margin:0}.leadbox{background:white;color:var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;width:min(420px,100%);box-shadow:0 20px 50px #0002}.leadbox h3{margin:0 0 5px}.leadbox p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 15px}.field{width:100%;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid #dbe2ee;border-radius:9px;margin:6px 0 10px;font:inherit}.leadbox .btn{width:100%}.note{font-size:11px!important;color:#7b879a!important;margin-top:10px!important}.formmsg{font-size:13px;color:#168c83;margin-top:9px;min-height:20px}.footer{background:#0b1327;color:#c4cde0;padding:42px 0 25px}.footgrid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}.footer p{color:#9ba9c4;max-width:440px;font-size:13px}.footlinks{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px}.copyright{border-top:1px solid #ffffff1a;margin-top:28px;padding-top:18px;color:#8290aa;font-size:12px}.mobile{display:none}
@media(max-width:900px){.links{gap:13px}.grid4,.audiences,.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.visual{min-height:330px}.split{gap:30px}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.stat:nth-child(2){border:0}}
@media(max-width:650px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 30px,1160px)}.navin{height:66px}.links{display:none}.mobile{display:inline-flex}.hero{padding:68px 0 55px}.hero-grid{gap:25px}h1{letter-spacing:-1.8px}.visual{min-height:300px;transform:scale(.88);margin:-10px -20px}.orbit{width:290px;height:290px}.f1{left:-10px}.f2{right:-12px}.section{padding:65px 0}.grid4,.audiences,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.stat{padding:18px 8px}.cta-in{display:block}.leadbox{margin-top:28px}.topbar .wrap{justify-content:center;text-align:center}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="topbar"><div class="wrap"><span>STRATEGY • VISIBILITY • CONNECTION • GROWTH</span><span>Build your presence. Grow your audience. Move your goals forward.</span></div></div>
<nav class="nav"><div class="wrap navin"><a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="Stack Leads Marketing home"><img class="brand-logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Stack Leads Marketing logo"></a><div class="links"><a href="#services">What We Do</a><a href="#approach">Our Approach</a><a href="#audiences">Who It Helps</a><a href="#resources">Get Started</a></div><a class="btn mobile" href="#resources">Get Started</a><a class="btn" href="#resources">Build Your Strategy</a></div></nav>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Digital marketing with direction</div><h1>Turn your message into <span class="gradient">measurable momentum.</span></h1><p>Strategic marketing helps you get discovered, earn trust and turn attention into action—whether you're growing a personal brand, professional practice, local storefront or ecommerce business.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="#services">Explore Marketing Solutions&nbsp; →</a><a class="btn outline" href="#approach">See How It Works</a></div><div class="trustline">More visibility. Better-fit leads. Stronger relationships. Sustainable growth.</div></div><div class="visual" aria-label="Marketing growth illustration"><div class="orbit"><div class="core">↗</div></div><div class="float f1">◎ Reach<small>Get discovered</small></div><div class="float f2">✦ Engage<small>Build connection</small></div><div class="float f3">＋ Convert<small>Inspire action</small></div><div class="float f4">↗ Grow<small>Measure progress</small></div></div></div></section>
<section class="stats"><div class="wrap" style="display:contents"><div class="stat"><strong>01</strong><span>Clear strategy before tactics</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>02</strong><span>Audience-first messaging</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>03</strong><span>Connected digital channels</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>04</strong><span>Trackable outcomes</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section soft" id="services"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="kicker">The growth toolkit</div><h2>Build a marketing engine around your goals.</h2><p>Bring the right channels, content and conversion methods together so every campaign has a purpose.</p></div><div class="grid4">
<article class="service"><div class="ico">◉</div><h3>Social Media Marketing</h3><p>Develop a consistent brand voice, publish useful content, build community and turn platform engagement into meaningful next steps.</p><span class="tag">Views • Followers • Engagement</span></article>
<article class="service"><div class="ico">⌕</div><h3>SEO & Search Visibility</h3><p>Improve discoverability with keyword research, helpful site content, on-page optimization, local SEO and search-friendly structure.</p><span class="tag">Rankings • Organic Traffic • Discovery</span></article>
<article class="service"><div class="ico">✧</div><h3>AI-Powered Marketing</h3><p>Use AI models and prompting to research audiences, generate content ideas, repurpose assets and streamline campaign workflows—with human review.</p><span class="tag">Prompts • Content • Efficiency</span></article>
<article class="service"><div class="ico">↗</div><h3>Lead Generation</h3><p>Create focused offers, landing pages, lead magnets, forms and follow-up journeys that turn interest into qualified inquiries.</p><span class="tag">Leads • Signups • Subscribers</span></article>
<article class="service"><div class="ico">★</div><h3>Reputation Marketing</h3><p>Build credibility through customer feedback, reviews, testimonials, case studies and thoughtful responses across relevant channels.</p><span class="tag">Trust • Reviews • Referrals</span></article>
<article class="service"><div class="ico">▣</div><h3>Content & Brand Strategy</h3><p>Shape a clear message and create articles, short videos, email campaigns and visual assets that speak to your audience's needs.</p><span class="tag">Messaging • Authority • Recall</span></article>
<article class="service"><div class="ico">◎</div><h3>Email & Nurture Campaigns</h3><p>Stay connected with subscribers and prospects through welcome sequences, useful updates, segmented campaigns and timely offers.</p><span class="tag">Subscribers • Retention • Sales</span></article>
<article class="service"><div class="ico">⌁</div><h3>Conversion Optimization</h3><p>Make it easier to take action with stronger calls to action, clearer pages, smoother checkout and ongoing performance testing.</p><span class="tag">Signups • Bookings • Purchases</span></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="approach"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="kicker">One connected strategy</div><h2>Marketing matters because visibility creates opportunity.</h2><p>Your audience may discover you on social media, compare options through search, check reviews, visit your store or browse your online shop. A coordinated digital presence helps your message stay consistent at every step.</p><ul class="checklist"><li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Be discoverable:</b> Show up where your audience searches, scrolls and explores.</span></li><li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Earn confidence:</b> Use clear information, useful content and credible social proof.</span></li><li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Make action simple:</b> Guide people toward a call, booking, signup, visit or purchase.</span></li><li><span class="check">✓</span><span><b>Learn and improve:</b> Measure results and refine what works.</span></li></ul><a class="btn" href="#resources">Start with Your Goals →</a></div><div class="panel"><h3>From first impression to loyal customer</h3><p>Design a journey—not just a collection of posts.</p><div class="funnel"><div><span>01 · Awareness</span><b>Views & reach</b></div><div><span>02 · Interest</span><b>Clicks & visits</b></div><div><span>03 · Consideration</span><b>Trust & inquiries</b></div><div><span>04 · Conversion</span><b>Leads & sales</b></div><div><span>05 · Loyalty</span><b>Reviews & referrals</b></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section soft" id="audiences"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="kicker">Flexible by design</div><h2>One strategy. Many ways to grow.</h2><p>Digital marketing supports your goals online and offline, across different business models and stages of growth.</p></div><div class="audiences"><div class="aud"><b>Personal Brands</b><span>Grow an audience, share expertise, build influence and create opportunities.</span></div><div class="aud"><b>Professionals & Services</b><span>Attract inquiries, consultations, appointments and qualified prospects.</span></div><div class="aud"><b>Local & Storefront</b><span>Increase local discovery, foot traffic, calls, bookings and repeat visits.</span></div><div class="aud"><b>Ecommerce & Online</b><span>Drive product discovery, email signups, cart conversions and customer loyalty.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="kicker">A practical roadmap</div><h2>Make every marketing move intentional.</h2><p>Start with a clear foundation, then build, launch and optimize with purpose.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><h3>Define</h3><p>Set your goals, identify your ideal audience and clarify what makes your offer valuable.</p></div><div class="step"><h3>Position</h3><p>Choose your message, keywords, content themes and the channels your audience uses.</p></div><div class="step"><h3>Activate</h3><p>Launch content, campaigns, lead capture and follow-up that move people toward action.</p></div><div class="step"><h3>Optimize</h3><p>Review analytics, test improvements and invest more in the activities producing results.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta" id="resources"><div class="wrap cta-in"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your next step starts here</div><h2>Ready to grow your reach<br>and turn attention into action?</h2><p>Share your goal and get a practical starting point for your marketing strategy.</p></div><form class="leadbox" id="leadForm"><h3>Get the Marketing Strategy Starter</h3><p>Tell us where you want to grow. This demo form shows how a lead-capture section can work.</p><label for="name">Your name</label><input class="field" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Name" required><label for="email">Email address</label><input class="field" id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required><label for="goal">Primary growth goal</label><select class="field" id="goal" name="goal"><option>More leads and inquiries</option><option>More views and followers</option><option>More subscribers and signups</option><option>More store visits and bookings</option><option>More ecommerce sales</option><option>Build my personal brand</option></select><button class="btn" type="submit">Request My Starter Guide →</button><div class="formmsg" id="formmsg" role="status"></div><p class="note">Demo only: connect this form to your CRM or email platform before publishing to collect submissions.</p></form></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="wrap"><div class="footgrid"><div><a class="brand footer-brand" href="#home">STACK LEADS MARKETING</a><p>Strategic digital marketing for people, professionals and businesses ready to grow their visibility, relationships and results.</p></div><div class="footlinks"><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#approach">Approach</a><a href="#audiences">Who We Help</a><a href="#resources">Get Started</a></div></div><div class="copyright">© <span id="year"></span> Stack Leads Marketing. All rights reserved.</div></div></footer>
<script>
document.getElementById('year').textContent=new Date().getFullYear();
document.getElementById('leadForm').addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();document.getElementById('formmsg').textContent='Thanks! The form layout is working. Connect a CRM or form service to receive and manage real submissions.';});
</script>
</body></html>
